{"id":"660573","name":"土豆西兰花羹","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/660573/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"1个"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西兰花焯水盛出。","img":"images/660573/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆切片蒸。","img":"images/660573/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒸熟的土豆，加清水用搅拌机搅成泥。","img":"images/660573/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里放少量水，放入土豆泥，小火煮。","img":"images/660573/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"西兰花加水在搅拌机里搅碎。","img":"images/660573/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入锅里，开大火，煮至冒大泡，多煮一会。","img":"images/660573/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盛入碗里，加适量香油更好吃。","img":"images/660573/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}